# Build context for infra/docker/*.Dockerfile (the repo root). Installs and builds happen inside the image.
.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.generated
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/.vite
**/.vite-temp

# Never bake secrets or personal notes into an image.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
SELFNOTES.md
DEPLOY-NOTES.md
